{
  "id": "four-player",
  "name": "Four players online (development, test group only)",
  "author": "BBEE modding project",
  "version": "0.3.11",
  "description": "Online co-op Mind Training for up to eight players, over Steam, without 91Act's servers: the host's game runs the fight and the others connect to it through Steam. Press X in the Mind Training room, or hold X on character select, to open the online menu; host a lobby, invite a Steam friend or join by player ID, and the lobby screen takes over: every player's card, hero and readiness. The host sets the run rules (Legacies, Potential cap, Mind Crystals, enemy scaling by player count) and can force start, kick and give host. Mod heroes are checked: a hero that every player does not have at the same version cannot be picked. Log: FourPlayer.log in the game's data folder. Unofficial. Development build for the test group.",
  "gameBuilds": [
    "25627491"
  ],
